---
const imageInput = "field h-auto py-3 file:mr-4 file:cursor-pointer file:border-0 file:bg-burgundy file:px-4 file:py-2.5 file:text-sm file:font-semibold file:tracking-[0.07em] file:text-cream file:uppercase hover:file:bg-rose-dusty";
const legend = "float-left mb-1 w-full font-display text-step-1 text-burgundy";
const hint = "m-0 min-h-5 text-sm text-ink-soft";
---
<dialog class="m-0 ml-auto h-dvh max-h-none w-[min(100vw,34rem)] max-w-none translate-x-full overflow-hidden border-0 bg-cream-soft p-0 text-ink shadow-[-24px_0_48px_-24px_rgb(74_15_34/0.5)] transition-transform duration-[380ms] ease-(--ease-out) backdrop:bg-burgundy-deep/55 backdrop:backdrop-blur-[2px] data-[open=true]:translate-x-0 motion-reduce:transition-none" data-sheet aria-labelledby="sheet-title">
  <form class="flex h-full flex-col" novalidate data-form>
    <header class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-b border-gold/55 bg-white px-6 py-4">
      <h2 id="sheet-title" class="text-step-1" data-title>Ajouter un produit</h2>
      <button class="icon-btn -mr-2" type="button" data-sheet-close aria-label="Fermer">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
      </button>
    </header>

    <div class="flex-1 overflow-y-auto px-6 py-6">
      <p class="m-0 mb-6 hidden border border-burgundy-deep bg-white p-4 text-burgundy-deep" role="alert" tabindex="-1" data-form-error></p>

      <div class="grid gap-9">
        <fieldset class="m-0 grid gap-5 border-0 p-0">
          <legend class={legend}>Informations</legend>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <label class="field-label" for="name">Nom du produit</label>
            <input class="field" id="name" name="name" type="text" maxlength="160" required aria-describedby="name-msg" />
            <p id="name-msg" class={hint} data-msg></p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <label class="field-label" for="slug">Adresse de la page</label>
            <div class="flex items-center border border-burgundy/45 bg-white has-focus-visible:outline-2 has-focus-visible:outline-offset-2 has-focus-visible:outline-burgundy has-aria-invalid:border-2 has-aria-invalid:border-burgundy-deep has-disabled:bg-cream-soft">
              <span class="pl-4 text-sm text-ink-soft select-none">/produit/</span>
              <input class="min-h-13 min-w-0 flex-1 border-0 bg-transparent px-1 pr-4 text-base outline-none disabled:text-ink-soft" id="slug" name="slug" type="text" maxlength="80" required aria-describedby="slug-msg" autocapitalize="none" spellcheck="false" />
            </div>
            <p id="slug-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Générée depuis le nom. Lettres, chiffres et tirets.">Générée depuis le nom. Lettres, chiffres et tirets.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <label class="field-label" for="collection">Collection</label>
            <select class="field" id="collection" name="collection">
              <option value="bladi">Bladi (cuir et tissu berbère)</option>
              <option value="zman">Z’man (velours et dorures)</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <label class="field-label" for="description">Description</label>
            <textarea class="field min-h-32 py-3 leading-relaxed" id="description" name="description" maxlength="2000" aria-describedby="description-msg"></textarea>
            <p id="description-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Matière, taille, finitions. Affichée sur la page produit et lue par Google.">Matière, taille, finitions. Affichée sur la page produit et lue par Google.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="m-0 grid gap-5 border-0 border-t border-gold/55 p-0 pt-8">
          <legend class={legend}>Prix</legend>
          <div class="grid gap-x-5 gap-y-5 min-[30rem]:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="grid content-start gap-2">
              <label class="field-label" for="price">Prix (dhs)</label>
              <input class="field tabular-nums" id="price" name="price" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" step="1" required aria-describedby="price-msg" />
              <p id="price-msg" class={hint} data-msg></p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid content-start gap-2">
              <label class="field-label" for="was_price">Prix barré</label>
              <input class="field tabular-nums" id="was_price" name="was_price" type="number" inputmode="numeric" min="1" step="1" aria-describedby="was_price-msg" />
              <p id="was_price-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Facultatif. Supérieur au prix.">Facultatif. Supérieur au prix.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="m-0 grid gap-5 border-0 border-t border-gold/55 p-0 pt-8">
          <legend class={legend}>Images</legend>
          <div class="grid gap-3">
            <label class="field-label" for="image">Image principale</label>
            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" class="hidden aspect-square w-full max-w-60 bg-white object-cover" alt="Aperçu de l’image principale" width="400" height="400" data-preview="image" />
            <input class={imageInput} id="image" name="image" type="file" accept="image/*" aria-describedby="image-msg" />
            <p id="image-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Recadrée en carré, au centre. Idéalement 1000 px ou plus.">Recadrée en carré, au centre. Idéalement 1000 px ou plus.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-3">
            <label class="field-label" for="image2">Seconde image</label>
            <img src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==" class="hidden aspect-square w-full max-w-60 bg-white object-cover" alt="Aperçu de la seconde image" width="400" height="400" data-preview="image2" />
            <input class={imageInput} id="image2" name="image2" type="file" accept="image/*" aria-describedby="image2-msg" />
            <p id="image2-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Facultatif. Montrée au survol dans la boutique.">Facultatif. Montrée au survol dans la boutique.</p>
            <button class="btn-ghost hidden justify-self-start" type="button" data-remove-image2>Retirer la seconde image</button>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-2">
            <label class="field-label" for="alt">Description de l’image</label>
            <input class="field" id="alt" name="alt" type="text" maxlength="200" aria-describedby="alt-msg" />
            <p id="alt-msg" class={hint} data-msg data-hint="Facultatif. Sans description, le nom du produit est utilisé. Une phrase aide les lecteurs d’écran et Google Images.">Facultatif. Sans description, le nom du produit est utilisé. Une phrase aide les lecteurs d’écran et Google Images.</p>
          </div>
        </fieldset>

        <fieldset class="m-0 grid gap-2 border-0 border-t border-gold/55 p-0 pt-8">
          <legend class={legend}>Affichage</legend>
          <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3"><input class="size-5 accent-burgundy" type="checkbox" name="active" checked /> Visible dans la boutique</label>
          <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center gap-3"><input class="size-5 accent-burgundy" type="checkbox" name="is_new" /> Afficher le badge « Nouveau »</label>
        </fieldset>

        <button class="btn-ghost hidden justify-self-start text-burgundy-deep" type="button" data-delete>Supprimer le produit</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <footer class="flex gap-3 border-t border-gold/55 bg-white px-6 py-4">
      <button class="btn flex-1 justify-center disabled:cursor-wait disabled:opacity-70" type="submit" data-submit><span data-submit-label>Enregistrer</span></button>
      <button class="btn-ghost min-h-13" type="button" data-sheet-close>Annuler</button>
    </footer>
  </form>
</dialog>

<dialog class="m-auto w-[min(92vw,26rem)] border border-gold/55 bg-white p-8 text-ink backdrop:bg-burgundy-deep/55" data-delete-dialog aria-labelledby="del-title">
  <h2 id="del-title" class="mb-3 text-step-1">Supprimer ce produit ?</h2>
  <p class="m-0 mb-6 text-ink-soft">« <span data-delete-name></span> » disparaît de la boutique et ses images sont effacées. Les commandes déjà passées sont conservées. Pour seulement le retirer de la vente, décochez « Visible dans la boutique ».</p>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3">
    <button class="btn-danger" type="button" data-delete-confirm>Supprimer</button>
    <button class="btn-ghost" type="button" data-delete-cancel autofocus>Garder</button>
  </div>
</dialog>
